// GN-13 (22 Oct 2026, owner decisions): 17TRACK registration — the settings screen
// (app/settings/TrackingRegistrationSection.tsx), the owner's "Register with 17TRACK" on the tracking panel
// and the server's fixed refusal sentences (functions/orders/trackingRegistrations.js decisionMessage).
